<title>GREECE: GREECE TO AUCTION 100BLN DRACHS OF 10YR BONDS JUN.</title>
<headline>GREECE TO AUCTION 100BLN DRACHS OF 10YR BONDS JUN.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece will auction 100 billion drachmas of 10-year fixed coupon bonds and reopen bids for 50 billion drachmas of three-year, 9.8 percent bonds, 50 billion of five-year, 9.2 percent bonds and 50 billion of seven-year, 8.9 percent bonds on June 17.</p>
</text>
